  "review": [
    "Original sendPlayers server-owned slot container IDs \u2192 chosen EntCon/container \u2192 MapACK matching container ID \u2192 sendLoginInfoToGameClient first EntCon.id verified. Queue passdbOrMapConnect forwards all7Pack1 fields unchanged despite stale local link_id label.",
    "Opaque session alone associates first field with validated existing/unlocked choice. WAIT_MAP phase checked before parse; full7field/end validation precedes positiveINT32 and nonzero owned selectiongen/serverUIDbound gates. Generic CohAuthMapHandoff.link_id remains raw unprivileged wire field.",
    "Successful handoff copy staged together with selectedslot/generation/DBID, then HANDOFF_READY. One-shot take begins graceful disconnect. Failure/refusal cannot publish identity; no standalone POD-to-DBID authority helper.",
    "Current+legacy and aligned+unaligned direct/queue/advertised profiles qualified with whole original producer/relay and explicit account/container/IP/packet factory shells. Source original read/write bit kernel unsanitized oracle; no original Win32/server acceptance.",
    "Normal non-slave Map self DBID must later match this owned value together with entity identity/generation and complete required full-update grammar. Local development auth remains provisional; no actor/fullcharacter/world/READY/RECEIVED_CHARACTER/ACK permit follows this correction."
  ],
